{"name":"Brassica","hex":"#788879","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Brassica","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A taxonomic genus within the family Brassicaceae – cabbages and related plants."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Brassica"}],"entries":[{"title":"Brassica","blocks":[{"text":"Brassica is a genus of plants in the cabbage and mustard family (Brassicaceae). The members of the genus are informally known as cruciferous vegetables, cabbages, mustard plants, or simply brassicas. Crops from this genus are sometimes called cole crops—derived from the Latin caulis, denoting the stem or stalk of a plant."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d9/Brassica_rapa_plant.jpg/330px-Brassica_rapa_plant.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brassica","wikidata":"Q58677"}],"images":[],"sounds":{},"pictures":[{"title":"Grey rectangle","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0f/Grey_rectangle.jpg/500px-Grey_rectangle.jpg","ratio":0.75,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Grey_rectangle.jpg","share":0.449375},{"title":"Mustard seedling","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f7/Mustard_seedling.jpg/500px-Mustard_seedling.jpg","ratio":1.3333333333333333,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mustard_seedling.jpg","share":0.33875},{"title":"Grey Carpet from above","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3c/Grey_Carpet_from_above.jpg/500px-Grey_Carpet_from_above.jpg","ratio":1.3333333333333333,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Grey_Carpet_from_above.jpg","share":0.25375},{"title":"Grey Bushchat in Sillery Gaon March 2025 by Tisha Mukherjee 01","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f9/Grey_Bushchat_in_Sillery_Gaon_March_2025_by_Tisha_Mukherjee_01.jpg/500px-Grey_Bushchat_in_Sillery_Gaon_March_2025_by_T